/Title (Get ready to make a global impact this Halloween by participating in our upcoming UNICEF Trunk-or-Treat event! As one of Key Club International's longest-standing global service partners, UNICEF has teamed up with the Kiwanis family for over three decades through the iconic Trick-or-Treat for UNICEF campaign. This year, our club is hosting a Trunk-or-Treat fundraiser to collect vital donations that support global initiatives, including Start Strong Zambia to improve early childhood development and efforts to eliminate maternal and neonatal tetanus. Members can get involved by decorating a car trunk, donating candy, or helping manage our contactless donation stations and orange collection boxes. Every dollar we raise helps protect and empower children in over 190 countries. Be sure to track your hours, as participating Key Clubbers will receive official school service-learning credits for their volunteer time!!!)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 570 0 R
/Next 638 0 R
