/Title (The Youth Opportunities Fund, offered by KEY Club International, provides grants of $250 to $2,000 for clubs. Applications are due by  October 15th for the first cycle and March 1st for the second cycle. Clubs must show participation in KEY Club activities, complete a community service project, collaborate on at least one Kiwanis Children's Fund project, and use the funds within 12 months.)
